$$
\begin{array}{l}
 C = \pi \times d
 \end{array}
$$

Step 2: The question tells us that the diameter of the circle is 8 m. Substitute 8 for the $d$ in the formula to find the circumference of the circle.

We will use 3.14 for $\pi$.

$$
\begin{array}{ll}
